  "description": "Become a blade that destroys demons!\n\n\"Demon Slayer -Kimetsu no Yaiba- The Hinokami Chronicles\" based on the anime adaptation of \"Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba\" is available for the PlayStation®4, PlayStation®5, Steam, Xbox One, Xbox Series X|S!\nBecome the Demon Slayer, Tanjiro Kamado, to fight off the demons threatening humanity in order to turn his sister Nezuko, who has become a demon, back into a human, as well as to avenge the death of his family by hunting down the demon who killed them.\n\nTanjiro and Nezuko join Versus Mode!\nFollowing his tutelage under Sakonji Urokodaki, Tanjiro has learned to wield \"Water Breathing\"!\n\n【Specs】\nTitle：Demon Slayer -Kimetsu no Yaiba- The Hinokami Chronicles\nGenre：Demon-slaying Action\nPlatform：PlayStation®4, PlayStation®5, Steam, Xbox One and Xbox Series X|S\nPlayers：1-2 (online mode available)\nRelease Date：Coming 14th October 2021\nDeveloper：CyberConnect2 Co., Ltd.\nProduction：Aniplex, Inc.\nPublisher：SEGA CORPORATION\n\n\"Demon Slayer -Kimetsu no Yaiba- The Hinokami Chronicles\" official site\nhttps://asia.sega.com/kimetsu_hinokami/en/\n\n©Koyoharu Gotoge / SHUEISHA, Aniplex, ufotable\n©DEMON SLAYER KIMETSU NO YAIBA THE HINOKAMI CHRONICLES COMMITTEE",
